          "docs": "<p>Configures one or more gateway local disks as cache for a gateway. This operation is only supported in the cached volume, tape, and file gateway type (see <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/latest/userguide/StorageGatewayConcepts.html\">How Storage Gateway works (architecture)</a>.</p> <p>In the request, you specify the gateway Amazon Resource Name (ARN) to which you want to add cache, and one or more disk IDs that you want to configure as cache.</p>"
